# AfriGIS geospatial data credentials.
# The frontend talks to a PostGIS-backed cache (indexed by H3 hex grids) that
# wraps AfriGIS, not the live AfriGIS API directly. These are placeholders only.
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in real values (never commit .env*).
AFRIGIS_CLIENT_NAME=trial-geotribe
AFRIGIS_CLIENT_ID=
AFRIGIS_CLIENT_SECRET=
AFRIGIS_API_KEY=
